From 2c4f52217cb1cae9061fe66b7699cec3bc2850a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 14:11:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 881/913] ta: pkcs11: check delete result and drop unused
 assignment
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

cleanup_persistent_object ignored the status of
TEE_CloseAndDeletePersistentObject1, so a failure to delete the
persistent object went unreported. Log it.

In entry_copy_object, rc was reset to PKCS11_CKR_OK at the end of the
CKA_EXTRACTABLE handling, but it is unconditionally reassigned just
below, so the stored value is never used. Drop it.

Coverity issue: CID 1201989: Unchecked return value from library in cleanup_persistent_object
Coverity issue: CID 1201959: Unused value in entry_copy_object

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git c512e8b7561f79ff2c61ec3948541006e3986854 ta: pkcs11: check delete result and drop unused assignment]
Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:Claude-Opus-5
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: Ie3b9a728892c2fac473645cb82d6d2d7a17ea790
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/597002
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 ta/pkcs11/src/object.c | 8 +++++---
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ta/pkcs11/src/object.c b/ta/pkcs11/src/object.c
index 4574f598a..ac6c532cc 100644
--- a/ta/pkcs11/src/object.c
+++ b/ta/pkcs11/src/object.c
@@ -115,8 +115,11 @@ void cleanup_persistent_object(struct pkcs11_object *obj,
 				       obj->uuid, sizeof(TEE_UUID),
 				       TEE_DATA_FLAG_ACCESS_WRITE_META,
 				       &obj->attribs_hdl);
-	if (!res)
-		TEE_CloseAndDeletePersistentObject1(obj->attribs_hdl);
+	if (!res) {
+		res = TEE_CloseAndDeletePersistentObject1(obj->attribs_hdl);
+		if (res)
+			TEE_Panic(res);
+	}
 
 	obj->attribs_hdl = TEE_HANDLE_NULL;
 	destroy_object_uuid(token, obj);
@@ -1250,7 +1253,6 @@ enum pkcs11_rc entry_copy_object(struct pkcs11_client *client, uint32_t ptypes,
 			if (rc)
 				goto out;
 		}
-		rc = PKCS11_CKR_OK;
 	}
 
 	/*
